<% page_title "FAQ" %>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="h-page">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
  <div class="card mt-8 p-6 md:p-8 space-y-8">
    <% [
      ["What is All In?",
       "All In is #{settings[:church_name]}'s pathway for new people. In three short steps you'll hear our story, discover how you're designed, and meet with someone from our team to find your place here."],
      ["How long does it take?",
       "Step One is a handful of short videos you can watch on your own schedule. Step Two is three quick assessments — most people finish in about 30 minutes total. Step Three is a single appointment."],
      ["I've completed Steps One and Two, but Step Three is still locked.",
       "Step Three unlocks once all three assessments show Complete on My Progress. If they do and it's still locked, sign out and back in, or email us and we'll take a look."],
      ["Can my spouse and I go through All In together?",
       "Yes — watch the videos together if you like, but each of you should create your own account so your assessment results stay separate. You're welcome to book one appointment together."],
      ["I can't make it in person. Can I still have my appointment?",
       "Yes. When you book, choose phone or video. On the day of your appointment you'll get an email with how to join and a link to your Personal Ministry Plan so you can follow along."],
      ["I'm part of another church. Can I still go through All In?",
       "You're welcome to watch the videos and learn about us. If you're committed to another local church, we'd encourage you to stay planted, serve, and give there — and keep joining us online any time."],
      ["I need to reschedule.",
       "Use the reschedule link in your booking confirmation email. If you can't find it, email #{settings[:church_email]} and we'll move it for you."],
      ["I need to update my email or phone number.",
       "Click Account at the top right, change your details, and save."],
      ["Can I delete my account?",
       "Yes. Email #{settings[:church_email]} and someone from the All In team will remove it."],
      ["I have a question that isn't listed here.",
       "Email #{settings[:church_email]} — a real person reads it."]
    ].each do |q, a| %>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold leading-snug"><%= q %></h2>
        <p class="text-mute mt-2 leading-relaxed max-w-[70ch]"><%= a %></p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
